   numerical optimiser, lbfgs, differentiates its objective SYMBOLICALLY, so
   it cannot take a quad_qags or quad_qawo value as the objective; there is no
   derivative-free maximiser: both rows SKIP.  See parametric_maximum.m. */
load("../harness.mac")$
load("../siam100_common.mac")$
skip("c9.machine", "black-box numeric maximiser")$
skip("c9.wp50", "black-box numeric maximiser")$
quit()$
